# Keep test files out of the deployment. Vercel turns every file under api/
# into a Serverless Function, and the Hobby plan caps a deployment at 12
# functions. The co-located api/**/*.test.ts files count against that ceiling
# (the project was sitting at exactly 12), so a new test file tipped the
# deploy over the limit and failed the build — even though `npm run build`
# and CI pass, since neither counts functions. Excluding tests drops the
# count to the real endpoints and leaves headroom. Tests still run in CI.
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx
